        {
          "title": "Open the request",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Tap the request on <strong>Requests</strong>, then <strong>Plan</strong>.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/69c62eb3400f0db8.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Check the plan",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>UAVOps picks the drone, window and route. Check them and the <strong>Weather</strong> and <strong>Range</strong> cells.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/2be974c05b5787e5.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Change the drone or time",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p><strong>Change</strong> takes another drone or a time typed like 1620. <strong>Update plan</strong> plans again.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/302c10c57fd9d793.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Send it",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Tap <strong>Send</strong>, and the mission opens on <strong>Missions</strong>, ready for <strong>Took off</strong>. If the plan has a problem, <strong>Check before sending</strong> comes first.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
